                        <property name="tooltip-text" translatable="1">If selected, the default book option for new files is set so that the 'Num' cell on registers shows/updates the split 'action' field and the transaction 'num' field is shown on the second line in double line view (and is not visible if that's not set). Otherwise, the default book option for new files is set so that the 'Num' cell on registers shows/updates the transaction 'num' field.</property>
