                        <property name="focusable">1</property>
                        <property name="has-tooltip">1</property>
                        <property name="tooltip-markup">Enable the UPDATE AND CLEAR action in the transaction matcher. If enabled, a transaction whose best match's score is above the Auto-CLEAR threshold and has a different date or amount than the matching existing transaction will cause the existing transaction to be updated and cleared by default.</property>
                        <property name="tooltip-text" translatable="1">Enable the UPDATE AND CLEAR action in the transaction matcher. If enabled, a transaction whose best match's score is above the Auto-CLEAR threshold and has a different date or amount than the matching existing transaction will cause the existing transaction to be updated and cleared by default.</property>
